          "stats": {
            "id": "levelled_description_17dea002f929",
            "level": {
              "value": 4
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You show off for the crowd. Attempt a Performance check; the DC is determined by the GM but is typically the standard DC for your level or the DC to Make an Impression on the spectators, whichever is higher. On a success, choose one of the following benefits; on a critical success, choose two benefits:\n\n- A number of temporary Hit Points equal to your character level; these last for 1 minute.\n- A +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the end of your next turn.\n- A +1 circumstance bonus to your next attack roll before the end of your next turn."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
